    "directions": [
      "In a large frying pan, add some coconut oil on a medium heat then add onions and garlic then caramelise for up to 5 minutes.",
      "then add curry powder and cook down until dark brown.",
      "Add coconut milk then stir to create a coconut curry sauce.",
      "Add carrots and bell peppers, pimento seeds and dried thyme then to mix together to create a thick curry paste.",
      "Now add in sea salt, black pepper, syrup and scotch bonnet pepper, then continue to mix together until sauce starts to boil",
      "Add Peas and beans to the pan, mix together and simmer until fully cooked then garnish with fresh parsley.",
      "Serve with steamed white rice and plantain."
    ],
